# T21 DoD-6 / Q19: the podium_fanfare stinger plays on Cup end for a silver or bronze trophy
# (gold plays cup_victory). Run with --quick-race aisle_rush --mode cup:rookie_cup (the cup starts at
# its last race, so this one race decides the trophy) and steering assist on in settings.ron: the
# player holds throttle from 5 s after GO to the finish (spot_podium.script: from GO).
wait racing
@300 hold keyboardA throttle 1
wait finished
release keyboardA
3.5 shot pod_01_results
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Continue → standings
2.0 shot pod_02_standings
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # to the ceremony
wait menu
3.0 shot pod_03_cup_end
2.0 exit
